title: "photonsfile: a pure-Python reader for Photonscore LINCam .photons (D7) files"
authors:
  - family-names: Hunt
    given-names: Alex
  - family-names: Akram
    given-names: Ahsan
type: software
license: MIT
version: 2026.7.14
date-released: 2026-07-14
