keywords:
  - Photonscore
  - LINCam
  - D7
  - photons
  - TCSPC
  - FLIM
abstract: >-
  A pure-Python reader for Photonscore LINCam .photons files, the D7 container.
  numpy only, with optional numba acceleration for the zigzag-varint decode. It
  decodes the per-photon x/y/dt/ms streams and bins them into an intensity image,
  a TCSPC decay, or a (Y, X, H) FLIM cube. Written from the open-sourced D7
  specification and validated bit-exact against the Photonscore SDK. Thank you to
  Photonscore GmbH for sharing the LINCam SDK and a sample file and for
  open-sourcing the D7 format; at their request the credit is to the company
  rather than an individual.
